<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  How was {{product_name}}?
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Review reminder
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Your order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> was delivered a few days ago. We would love your thoughts on <strong>{{product_name}}</strong>.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Leaving a short review helps other shoppers and lets sellers know how they did.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Order number" value=order_number}}
  {{> detail-row label="Product" value=product_name}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="It only takes a minute"}}
  Open the product from your order history and share a rating and a few words about your experience.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thanks for shopping with Dukka.
</p>
